@startuml single_post_view_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowout false

skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #475569
    ArrowFontSize 10
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
    FontColor #92400E
}

title **Modern Laravel Blog - Single Post View & Route Model Binding Flow**

|#EFF6FF|Visitor (Client Browser)|
|#F0FDF4|Router & PostController|
|#FEFCE8|Post Model (Eloquent)|
|#FAF5FF|SQLite Database & Blade Components|

|Visitor (Client Browser)|
start
:Visitor clicks on a post card or navigates to:\n**GET /posts/{post:slug}**;

|Router & PostController|
:Laravel Router intercepts request;
:Execute Implicit Route Model Binding using slug:\n""Post::where('slug', $slug)->firstOrFail()"";

|SQLite Database & Blade Components|
:Execute SELECT query on SQLite **posts** table;

if (Post record found?) then (no - Slug Missing)
    |Router & PostController|
    :Throw **ModelNotFoundException**;
    |Visitor (Client Browser)|
    :Display Custom 404 Not Found Page\nwith "Return to Home" action; <<#FEE2E2>>
    stop
else (yes - Post Exists)
    |Router & PostController|
    :Invoke **PostController@show(Post $post)**;

    |Post Model (Eloquent)|
    :Query 3 related posts from same category:\n""Post::where('category_id', $post->category_id)""\n""  ->where('id', '!=', $post->id)""\n""  ->latest()->take(3)->get()"";
    :Eager load **author** and **category** relationships;

    |SQLite Database & Blade Components|
    :Execute SELECT query for related articles;
    :Compile view **posts.show** with Blade components:
    - **<x-public-layout>** (SEO title & meta tags)
      - Breadcrumb navigation (Home > Category > Post)
      - Category badge via **<x-badge>**
      - Post Title & Author byline (avatar, published date)
      - Full featured image from **storage/posts/**
      - Formatted article body paragraphs
      - Author Bio callout card with author posts link
      - Related articles grid (3 cards);

    |Visitor (Client Browser)|
    :Display complete, beautifully styled article\nwith reading time & related suggestions; <<#DCFCE7>>
    stop
endif

@enduml
